# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Open-source repository exclusions
#
# Kept out of Git on purpose:
#   /artifacts  - milestone evidence, bundled LibreOffice binaries (third-party
#                 redistribution), downloaded model weights (~1.26 GB)
#   /backups    - full source snapshots taken before each milestone
#   *.apk       - build outputs; the local APKs are debug-signed
#   *.docx      - business plan and other private material
#   *.litertlm  - model weights, downloaded at runtime instead
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/artifacts/
/backups/
*.apk
*.aab
*.docx
*.litertlm
*.part

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db